.IX Title "LEI-REFRESH-MAIL-SYNC 1"
.TH LEI-REFRESH-MAIL-SYNC 1 1993-10-02 public-inbox.git "public-inbox user manual"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
